  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until translucent",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute",
    "Add the mung bean sprouts and cook until they start to soften",
    "Add the lemon juice, orange zest, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine",
    "Add the cooked rice to the skillet and stir to combine with the mung bean sprouts and seasonings",
    "Cook for an additional 2-3 minutes, stirring constantly, until the rice is heated through and starting to brown",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional orange zest if desired"
